#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:7 6e62f7824796473f9a96ea969981006b
msgid "Case Study: OpenHarness"
msgstr "案例研究：OpenHarness"

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:9 0d836ba917194582b7be8fc4571cbb13
msgid "*The closest thing to a textbook harness that ships as open source.*"
msgstr "*开源世界里，最接近\"教科书级挽具\"的那一具。*"

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:11 ea15bfae5b064a659240ea55718e666a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"OpenHarness, authored by the HKU Data Science Lab (HKUDS) and released as "
"MIT-licensed open source {cite}`hkuds2025openharness`, is the reference "
"implementation the book returns to most often. It reads as if its authors "
"had already written Chapter 05: the repository is neatly divided into ten "
"subsystems, each of which maps onto a specific cell or small cluster of "
"cells in the three-guardian × four-zone matrix. This chapter walks through "
"those subsystems, quotes the Agent Loop core, and scores the whole project "
"against the Ch.05 matrix."
msgstr ""
"OpenHarness 由香港大学数据科学实验室（HKUDS）编写，以 MIT 许可开源发布 "
"{cite}`hkuds2025openharness`。它是本书最常回头引用的那份参考实现。读它的感觉，就像作者们已经先写过第 05 "
"章：仓库整齐地分成十个子系统，每一个都刚好对应到\"三护法 × 四区域\"矩阵里的某一格、或某一小簇格子。本章逐个走过这些子系统、引用 Agent "
"Loop 核心那一小段代码，并给整个项目按第 05 章的矩阵打一次分。"

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:20 15ea4a16a93b4f4d98d7a235edc6b2b9
msgid "§07.1 — Ten subsystems at a glance"
msgstr "§07.1 —— 一眼看清十个子系统"

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:22 9e130ca8e8c740f4816ca7daa542661a
msgid ""
"OpenHarness as of the 2026-03 snapshot is organised around ten subsystems "
"that roughly correspond to the ten directories under `src/openharness/` in "
"the upstream tree:"
msgstr ""
"以 2026-03 的快照为准，OpenHarness 围绕十个子系统组织，大致对应上游仓库 `src/openharness/` 下面的十个目录："

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:26 639349481427484f91cb3ca434f3c78f
msgid "`api/` — OpenAI-compatible clients and Copilot auth adapters."
msgstr "`api/` —— OpenAI 兼容的客户端，以及 Copilot 认证适配器。"

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:27 8ea76885327040439ee50cfc7a6992e7
msgid ""
"`autopilot/` — the long-running agent service that the book's Chapter 02 "
"stage-4 example alludes to."
msgstr "`autopilot/` —— 那个长期运行的智能体服务，本书第 02 章第 4 阶段的例子就隐指它。"

#: ../../source/chapters/07-openharness.md:29 10ebed1f414e49f8b1af532d83714027
msgid ""
"`channels/` — integrations with Slack, Discord, Feishu, Telegram, and eight "
